{"articleNo":"1066","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1066&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010년도 해외취업 연수과정 연수생 모집 안내 [한국산업인력공단]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.02.08","hit":"12793","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">한국산업인력공단은 국내․외 해외취업 전문교육기관들과 함께 국제기업의 요구에 부합하는 인재양성을 위하여 다음과 같이&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">해외취업 연수</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">프로그램을 개설하여</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> 연수 참가 희망자를 모집․</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">안내하오니 많은 지원바랍니다.<br><br><br><br></span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">� 해외취업연수 프로그램</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 45.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">대상국가 : 일본, 중국, 캐나다, 호주, 뉴질랜드, 말레이시아, 미국, 베트남,&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 싱가포르, 필리핀, 카타르, 아랍에미리트 등 12개 국가</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 45.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">분야</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">(직종)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">국제비즈니스, 호텔서비스관광, IT, 그래픽디자인, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">미용,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">설계엔지니어,</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">한국어강사, 인재경영관리전문가, 의류․패션디자인,<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 국제유아교사,</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">국제태권도사범양성, 육가공실무, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">호텔조리사,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 일식조리사, 제과․제빵, 용접, 타일, 항공승무원 등</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 45.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">○ 연수과정 : 항공승무원, 국제비즈니스 등 346개 과정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 45.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">○ 연수기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3~12개월(대부분 6~8개월)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 45.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">○ 연수인원 : 총 12,371명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 45.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">� 지원내용</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 연수비는 월평균 45~50만원 수준에서 지급, 수료 후 취업지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(단, 현지연수의 경우 생활비, 교통비 등은 지급되지 않음)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">� 연수대상 및 지원자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 49.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">29세 이하(1981. 1. 1 이후 출생)인 미취업자(남자는 군필 및 면제자)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;※ 단, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">연수과정별 연수인원의 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">30%</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">범위 내에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">30</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">세 이상자도 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">선발 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 49.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">해외여행 및 해당국가 취업비자 발급에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 50.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">해당 국가의 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">비자발급</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"> 요건을 고려하여 학력, 경력 등 지원 자격</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">요건이</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"> 추가될 수 있음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 50.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">� 모집시기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 연중 모집</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">� 지원방법</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 온라인 지원(우편접수 불가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 45.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">공단 해외취업사이트(www.worldjob.or.kr) 접속 → </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">회원 가입 → 로그인 후 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">‘이력서/</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">자기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">소개서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"> 작성’</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"> → ‘연수 모집</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">정보’ → ‘해당 연수과정’ 선택 → ‘지원하기’ </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">� 문의처</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 48.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">○ 한국산업인력공단 취업연수팀 : ☎ 02-3271-9151～7</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 48.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">○ 연수과정별 세부 안내는 월드잡 사이트(</span><a href=\"http://www.worldjob.or.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: none\">www.worldjob.or.kr)</span></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">를 확인하시고,&nbsp; 해당 연수기관으로 문의 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 48.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">� 유의사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 48.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">○ 국비지원금과 별도로 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">연수생이 부담해야할 개인부담금이</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> 있으므로 반드시 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 48.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;연수기관과 월드잡 사이트를 통해 해당 연수과정 확인 후 지원 바람</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 50.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">취업은 소정의 연수과정 수료 후 해외 구인업체의 선발절차를</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> 거쳐 결정됨</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 51pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">○ 취업 확정시 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">연수과정 수료 후 6개월 내에 출국함을 원칙으로</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> 함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 58.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt\">해당국가의 부득이한 사정으로 취업비자발급이 지연될 시에는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">해당기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">만큼 출국이 지연될 수 있음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 48.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">국가별, 취업직종, 개별 근로계약에 따라 급여 등 근로조건은 차이가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> 있음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 52pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">한국산업인력공단은 연수기관에 연수과정을 위탁운영하며, 연수생 선발,</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 52pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;연</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">수실시, 취업지원 등은 연수기관에서 담당</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 52pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 7.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
